  "title": {
   "en": "Satori Reijou no Misukasenai Kanjou"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "サトリ令嬢の見透かせない感情"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Lady Who Reads Minds and the Duke's Hidden Feelings"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"The Baron's Daughter Who Reads Minds... and the Duke's Hidden Obsession!\"\n\nThe daughter of a poor baron possesses a rare ability—she can hear people's hidden thoughts. But this gift is not always a blessing, as she is constantly bombarded by the dark truths of high society, where elegant appearances hide deceitful intentions. Determined to avoid entanglement in this world of hypocrisy, she crosses paths with the heir of a prestigious ducal family—a man known for his charm, elegance, and impeccable manners. At first glance, he appears to be the perfect gentleman...\n\nBut when she listens to his thoughts, she discovers a shocking truth—he is completely obsessed with her! To her dismay, his refined and graceful exterior is nothing like what goes on in his mind, which is filled with overwhelming emotions she never expected. No matter how hard she tries to distance herself, he only seems more determined to get closer! Will she be able to escape his relentless pursuit, or has her fate already been sealed?"
  },
